  Cell[CellGroupData[{Cell[TextData[{"Measurement and reproduction"}], 
      "Section"], Cell[TextData[{"The ", ButtonBox["frozen protocol", 
         BaseStyle -> "Hyperlink", ButtonData -> 
          {"../docs/notes/OEISCorpusExperiment.md", None}], " defines \
eligibility, search budgets, seeds and controls. Of 393,450 source records, \
283,167 qualify. Search sees only eight training terms at their original \
indices; names, formulas, existing WL code and test terms are withheld. \
Selection uses rechecked training accuracy, then smaller programs, then lower \
seeds."}], "Text"], Cell[TextData[{"The complete first seed produced 8,626 \
training fits, 876 primary successes and eighty all-recorded successes; three \
searches timed out. The headline 9,110/897/91 includes a partially completed \
second seed, with 283,165 entries having a completed candidate. The \
four-method comparison uses 2,048 matched entries and excludes the forty \
pilot IDs. Each method tries 464 programs, but random search samples depth \
three while evolution starts at depth two. The larger-search control changes \
both program depth and the number of candidates, so it does not isolate \
either effect. These counts measure this search at its recorded budget, not \
the language's expressive limit or a speed advantage over WL methods."}], 
      "Text"], Cell[TextData[{"Mathematica 15.0.0 computed all statistics and \
42 figures; the lambda trees use Wolfram/Lambda 1.2.6. The notebook contains \
editable graphics and executable Input cells; its closed initialization \
section imports the fixed data without restarting the search. The compressed \
records preserve all 9,110 programs, sequences, loss histories, per-term \
checks and standalone WL functions, plus the matched comparisons. Every WL \
function agrees with all completed Recursor outputs; \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]compact\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] means the shortest \
verified candidate among the implemented translations, not global \
minimality."}], "Text"], Cell[TextData[{"Recursor revision: ", 
        StyleBox["e7786c8b9200a308e495a91e6bb66000d0fa0462", "Input"], ". ", 
